(H/'README.md').write_text('# Normal-line inventory package\n\nGenerator: ../17592186092240.py, UUID '+c['generator_id']+'. Validated moderate two-blank questions only. classification.md and capability.json document excluded profiles and unsupported levels. Native blank grading, exhaustive bounded mathematics, prompt/source-bank replay and reproducibility checks are retained in validation.json. review.md shows originals, replay and variants. replenish.py serializes with application api.lock, rechecks inventory at one basis, excludes shown/reserved/invalid or duplicate tasks, previews deployed specs and saves exact guarded requests, receipts and exact-basis verification. Only this KP membership and generator registration receive additive changes; originals and learner history are preserved.\n')
